  "title": "The Commandments — Treasure, Trust and Watchfulness",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2.5rem\",\"bottom\":\"4rem\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4rem\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"fontSize\":\"2.6rem\"}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#b3261e;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:2.6rem\">Treasure, Trust and Watchfulness</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/instructions/\">Read Instructions</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/instructions-index/\">Instructions index</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/beyond-the-torah/\">Beyond the Torah</a> · <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/individual-command-counting-method/\">Counting and classification guide</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This page preserves the numbered Christ studies and their quoted passages. <a href=\"/instructions/treasure-trust-and-watchfulness/\">Open the complementary Harmony study</a>. The two views serve different purposes; their entry counts are not added together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Verified Saints Translation links.</strong> Biblical references open the Saints chapter at its exact verse anchor. Saints numbering appears first; corresponding KJV numbers are shown where they differ. Ranges open at their first verse. <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#citation-audit\">Read the citation and numbering notes</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"saints-pericope\"} -->\n<p class=\"saints-pericope\">The Commandments of Christ · His own commandments: in the world · 74–90</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-prayer-fasting-giving/\">← Prayer, Fasting and Giving</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-the-church-and-its-mission/\">The Church and Its Mission →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:17px\">Possessions, anxiety, fear, false teachers, and readiness for His coming.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:16px\"><strong>On this page:</strong> <a href=\"#t5-1\">Treasure</a> · <a href=\"#t5-2\">Trust</a> · <a href=\"#t5-3\">Watchfulness</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t5-1\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t5-1\">Treasure</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k74\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k74\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>74.</strong> Not to store up treasures on earth, but in heaven.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Do not store up treasures for yourselves upon earth, where moth and consumption destroy and where thieves break through and steal.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But store up treasures for yourselves in heaven, where neither moth nor consumption destroys and where thieves neither break through nor steal.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For where your treasure is, there your heart will also be.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-19\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:19–21\">Matthew 6:19–21</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-33\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:33–34\">Luke 12:33–34</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k75\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k75\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>75.</strong> You cannot serve God and mammon.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">No one can serve as a slave to two masters: for he will either hate the one and love the other, or hold to one and despise the other. You cannot serve as a slave to God and mammon.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-24\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:24\">Matthew 6:24</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-16/#v16-13\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 16:13\">Luke 16:13</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k76\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k76\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>76.</strong> To guard against all greed, for life is not in the abundance of possessions.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And He said to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“See to it that you guard against every kind of greed, because a person’s life does not consist in the abundance of his possessions.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:15\">Luke 12:15</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-28\">28. Rejecting covetous desire</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k77\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k77\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>77.</strong> To make friends by means of unrighteous mammon; to be faithful in very little.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And I tell you, make friends for yourselves from the mammon of unrighteousness, so that when it fails, they may welcome you into the eternal tents.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The one who is faithful in the least is faithful also in much, and the one who is unrighteous in the least is unrighteous also in much.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-16/#v16-9\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 16:9–10\">Luke 16:9–10</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k78\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k78\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>78.</strong> To give to Caesar what is Caesar’s, and to God what is God’s.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They say to Him, “Caesar’s.” Then He says to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Render therefore to Caesar the things of Caesar, and to God the things of God.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-22/#v22-21\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 22:21\">Matthew 22:21</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-12/#v12-17\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 12:17\">Mark 12:17</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-20/#v20-25\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 20:25\">Luke 20:25</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t5-2\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t5-2\">Trust</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k79\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k79\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>79.</strong> Not to be anxious for your life, what you will eat or wear.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Therefore I tell you: do not be anxious about your life, what you will eat or what you will drink, or about your body, what you will wear. Is life not more than food, and the body more than clothing?</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Look at the birds of the sky: they do not sow or reap or gather into storehouses, yet your heavenly Father feeds them. Are you not worth more than they?</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-25\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:25–26\">Matthew 6:25–26</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-31\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:31–34\">Matthew 6:31–34</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-22\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:22–31\">Luke 12:22–31</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k80\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k80\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>80.</strong> Not to fear those who kill the body; to fear Him who can destroy both soul and body.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Do not fear those who kill the body but cannot kill the soul; rather fear Him who can destroy both soul and body in Gehenna.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-28\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:28\">Matthew 10:28</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-4\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:4–5\">Luke 12:4–5</a><br><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-110\">110. Learning reverence for God</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k81\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k81\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>81.</strong> Not to let your heart be troubled; to believe in God and in Him.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Do not let your heart be troubled. Believe in God, and believe also in Me.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-14/#v14-1\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 14:1\">John 14:1</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-14/#v14-27\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 14:27\">John 14:27</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k82\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k82\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>82.</strong> To take courage: He has overcome the world.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">These things I have spoken to you so that in Me you may have peace. In the world you have affliction; but take courage: I have overcome the world.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-16/#v16-33\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 16:33\">John 16:33</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t5-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t5-3\">Watchfulness</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k83\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k83\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>83.</strong> To stay awake, for you do not know the day or the hour.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Therefore keep watch, because you know neither the day nor the hour.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-25/#v25-13\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 25:13\">Matthew 25:13</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-24/#v24-42\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 24:42–44\">Matthew 24:42–44</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-13/#v13-33\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 13:33–37\">Mark 13:33–37</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-35\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:35–40\">Luke 12:35–40</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k84\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k84\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>84.</strong> To watch yourselves, lest your hearts be weighed down, and to stay awake at all times, praying.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But watch yourselves, lest your hearts be weighed down with carousing and drunkenness and the cares of life, and that day come upon you suddenly</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">like a trap. For it will come upon all who dwell on the face of the whole earth.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But stay awake at every season, praying that you may have strength to escape all these things that are about to happen and to stand before the Son of Man.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-21/#v21-34\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 21:34–36\">Luke 21:34–36</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k85\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k85\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>85.</strong> To beware of false prophets, who come in sheep’s clothing.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Beware of false prophets, who come to you in sheep’s clothing but inwardly are ravenous wolves.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">You will recognize them by their fruits. Do people gather grapes from thornbushes, or figs from thistles?</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-7/#v7-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 7:15–16\">Matthew 7:15–16</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-24/#v24-4\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 24:4–5\">Matthew 24:4–5</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-13/#v13-5\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 13:5–6\">Mark 13:5–6</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-21/#v21-8\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 21:8\">Luke 21:8</a><br><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-125\">125. Rejecting a prophet who leads to other gods</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k86\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k86\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>86.</strong> To beware of the leaven of the Pharisees.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jesus said to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Look out and beware of the leaven of the Pharisees and Sadducees.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-16/#v16-6\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 16:6\">Matthew 16:6</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-8/#v8-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 8:15\">Mark 8:15</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-1\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:1\">Luke 12:1</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k87\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k87\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>87.</strong> Not to give what is holy to dogs or cast your pearls before swine.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Do not give what is holy to dogs or throw your pearls before pigs, lest they trample them with their feet and turn and tear you apart.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-7/#v7-6\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 7:6\">Matthew 7:6</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k88\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k88\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>88.</strong> To be prudent as snakes and innocent as doves.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Behold, I send you as sheep in the midst of wolves. So become prudent as snakes and innocent as doves.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-16\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:16\">Matthew 10:16</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k89\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k89\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>89.</strong> To remember Lot’s wife.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Remember Lot’s wife.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Whoever seeks to preserve his life will lose it, but whoever loses it will keep it alive.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-17/#v17-32\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 17:32–33\">Luke 17:32–33</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k90\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k90\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>90.</strong> To acknowledge Him before people.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Therefore everyone who acknowledges Me before people, I too will acknowledge before My Father in the heavens.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But whoever denies Me before people, I too will deny before My Father in the heavens.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-32\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:32–33\">Matthew 10:32–33</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-8\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:8–9\">Luke 12:8–9</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-8/#v8-38\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 8:38\">Mark 8:38</a><br><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/law/leviticus/chapter-22/#v22-32\" title=\"Saints Translation — Leviticus 22:32\">Leviticus 22:32</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-prayer-fasting-giving/\">← Prayer, Fasting and Giving</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-the-church-and-its-mission/\">The Church and Its Mission →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"14px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#8a8a8a;font-size:14px\">Saints Translation · The Commandments of Christ · gathered from His own words in the four Gospels; statements in our own words; passages quoted from the Saints Translation with His words in red · working draft awaiting specialist review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
